# ...but whitelist the small raw benchmark files so the repo is self-contained.
# LoCoMo (~2.7 MB): CC BY-NC 4.0, safe to redistribute for research.
!2027_reproduce_memory_r1/data/
!2027_reproduce_memory_r1/data/raw/
