# LongMemEval oracle (~15 MB): safe. The larger _s (265 MB) and _m (2.5 GB) splits exceed
# GitHub's 100 MB per-file limit — download via `scripts/download_datasets.py`.
!2027_reproduce_memory_r1/data/raw/longmemeval/
!2027_reproduce_memory_r1/data/raw/longmemeval/longmemeval_oracle.json
!2027_reproduce_memory_r1/data/raw/longmemeval/README.md

